  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5003.01 Certificate Required",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-11-11",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5003.01 Certificate Required. No display of display fireworks shall be conducted unless at least one person with a current certificate of competency for the display of display fireworks is physically present at all times during the delivery, setting up, loading, and firing of the display. The person with a current certificate of competency shall oversee and assure that the display is being conducted in a safe and secure manner.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95; ss by #7481, eff 4-25-01, EXPIRED: 4-25-09\n\nNew. #9471, INTERIM, eff 5-15-09, EXPIRED: 11-11-09\n\nNew. #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5000.html"
